msgid "Weather"
msgstr "Izulu"

#: data/org.gnome.Weather.appdata.xml.in.in:6
#: data/org.gnome.Weather.desktop.in.in:5
msgid "Show weather conditions and forecast"
msgstr "Khombisa isimo sezulu nesibikizelo"

#: data/org.gnome.Weather.appdata.xml.in.in:16
msgid ""
"A small application that allows you to monitor the current weather "
"conditions for your city, or anywhere in the world."
msgstr ""
"Uhlelwana olukuvumela ukuhlola isimo sezulu sesimanje endaweni yakho nanoma "
"kuphi emhlabeni."

#: data/org.gnome.Weather.appdata.xml.in.in:20
msgid ""
"It provides access to detailed forecasts, up to 7 days, with hourly details "
"for the current and next day, using various internet services."
msgstr ""
"Kwethula izibikezelo eziphelele ngezinsuku eziyi-7 ngemininingwane efika "
"njalo ngehora nganamuhla nekusasa ngokusebenzisa uxhakaxholo."

#: data/org.gnome.Weather.appdata.xml.in.in:24
msgid ""
"It also optionally integrates with the GNOME Shell, allowing you to see the "
"current conditions of the most recently searched cities by just typing the "
"name in the Activities Overview."
msgstr ""

#: data/org.gnome.Weather.appdata.xml.in.in:199
msgid "The GNOME Project"
msgstr "Umklamo weGNOME"

